<title>NETHERLANDS: Hagemeyer sells Union unit to Bimaco.</title>
<headline>Hagemeyer sells Union unit to Bimaco.</headline>
<dateline>NAARDEN, Netherlands 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch trading company Hagemeyer NV said on Friday it had sold its bicycle producing subsidiary Union BV to Bimaco.</p>
<p>Hong Kong's First Pacific Co has a controlling stake in Hagemeyer.</p>
